    "annotations": {"list": []},
    "templating": {"list": []},
    "panels": [
      {
        "id": 100,
        "type": "row",
        "title": "泳道 1 · 请求生命周期（CPU → 调度 → GPU 一步）",
        "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0},
        "collapsed": false,
        "panels": []
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "type": "text",
        "title": "生命周期总览",
        "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 16, "x": 0, "y": 1},
        "transparent": true,
        "options": {
          "mode": "html",
          "code": {
            "language": "html",
            "showLineNumbers": false
          },
          "content": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:stretch;gap:6px;margin-bottom:10px\">\n  <div style=\"flex:1;border:2px solid #5794f2;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;background:rgba(87,148,242,.08)\">\n    <div style=\"font-weight:700;color:#5794f2;margin-bottom:4px\">① CPU · MM Processor</div>\n    <div style=\"color:#ccc\">解码图片/视频 · SHM cache</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#999;margin-top:6px\">不占 GPU 16384 · 可能 deferred</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;color:#888;font-size:20px\">→</div>\n  <div style=\"flex:1;border:2px solid #ffb357;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;background:rgba(255,179,87,.08)\">\n    <div style=\"font-weight:700;color:#ffb357;margin-bottom:4px\">② Scheduler · schedule()</div>\n    <div style=\"color:#ccc\">决定本 step 装多少 E 和 P/D</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#999;margin-top:6px\">扣两套独立 budget · waiting 在这层之前</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;color:#888;font-size:20px\">→</div>\n  <div style=\"flex:1.2;border:2px solid #73bf69;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;background:rgba(115,191,105,.08)\">\n    <div style=\"font-weight:700;color:#73bf69;margin-bottom:4px\">③ GPU · 1 个 engine step</div>\n    <div style=\"color:#ccc\"><b>先 E</b> vision encoder → <b>后 P/D</b> LLM forward</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#999;margin-top:6px\">不是两个 step · 是同一 iteration 内两段 GPU 计算</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding:8px 12px;border-left:4px solid #f2495c;background:rgba(242,73,92,.06);border-radius:4px;color:#ddd;font-size:12px\">\n  <b>Waiting 高 ≠ 2×16384 打满</b>：capacity=硬等（slot/KV/token）；deferred=软等（CPU MM/SHM/blocked），见右侧曲线。\n</div>\n</div>"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "队列状态（调度层之前）",
        "description": "running=已占 slot；waiting=capacity+deferred；与 step 内 token 预算是不同维度。",
        "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 1},
        "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "efphcpq654uf4f"},
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "custom": {"drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 15},
            "min": 0
          },
          "overrides": [
            {"matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "waiting total"}, "properties": [{"id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": {"dash": [10, 10], "fill": "dash"}}]},
            {"matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "deferred"}, "properties": [{"id": "color", "value": {"fixedColor": "orange", "mode": "fixed"}}]},
            {"matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "capacity"}, "properties": [{"id": "color", "value": {"fixedColor": "red", "mode": "fixed"}}]}
          ]
        },
        "targets": [
          {"expr": "vllm:num_requests_running{model_name=\"Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8\"}", "legendFormat": "running", "refId": "A"},
          {"expr": "vllm:num_requests_waiting{model_name=\"Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8\"}", "legendFormat": "waiting total", "refId": "B"},
          {"expr": "vllm:num_requests_waiting_by_reason{model_name=\"Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8\",reason=\"capacity\"}", "legendFormat": "capacity", "refId": "C"},
          {"expr": "vllm:num_requests_waiting_by_reason{model_name=\"Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8\",reason=\"deferred\"}", "legendFormat": "deferred", "refId": "D"}
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 200,
        "type": "row",
        "title": "泳道 2 · Step N 放大（双预算 · 先 E 后 P/D）",
        "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 7},
        "collapsed": false,
        "panels": []
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "type": "text",
        "title": "Step 结构说明",
        "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 8},
        "transparent": true,
        "options": {
          "mode": "markdown",
          "content": "### 同一 iteration 内的 GPU 顺序\n\n```\nStep N\n┌─────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ 预算 A  Encoder  ≤ 16384 embeds     │ → Vision Encoder\n│         ↓                           │\n│ 预算 B  LLM P+D  ≤ 16384 tokens     │ → Transformer + Sample\n└─────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**两套 16384 独立扣减，不要 E+P+D 相加后和一个 16384 比。**\n\n右侧 Bar gauge = 上一 iteration 预算利用率（来自 iteration 日志 exporter）。"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "type": "bargauge",
        "title": "预算 A · Encoder output embeddings / 16384",
        "description": "vllm_batch_encoder_output_embeddings，上一 iteration 的 MM encoder 输出 embedding 数。",
        "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 8},
        "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "efxtwpht5answc"},
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "min": 0,
            "max": 16384,
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {"color": "green", "value": null},
                {"color": "yellow", "value": 12000},
                {"color": "red", "value": 15000}
              ]
            },
            "color": {"mode": "thresholds"},
            "unit": "none"
          }
        },
        "options": {
          "orientation": "horizontal",
          "displayMode": "gradient",
          "showUnfilled": true,
          "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}
        },
        "targets": [
          {"expr": "vllm_batch_encoder_output_embeddings", "legendFormat": "E embeds", "refId": "A"}
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "type": "bargauge",
        "title": "预算 B · LLM P+D tokens / 16384",
        "description": "vllm_batch_total_tokens = context_tokens + generation_tokens，不含 encoder。",
        "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 8},
        "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "efxtwpht5answc"},
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "min": 0,
            "max": 16384,
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
